<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - ING Barings ups Telebras to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ING Barings ups Telebras to buy.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said it upgraded Brazilian telecommunications holding Telebras to buy from hold based on a drop in the stock's performance this week.</p>
<p>Telebras' stock price went down 17.5 percent since ING Barings downgraded it to hold July 10, the bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
